    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Audit Also Records the Rule and Reason"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In Query Audit, I opened the 16:21:11 record: Demo Developer, Agentless Proxy, Failure, and Prevented."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Details retained the executed SQL and Error Message, including query_rule_id: 1 and the same guidance seen in DBeaver."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/query-rules/08.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 8. Audit details contain the SQL, rule ID, and message displayed to the user.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 8. Audit details contain the SQL, rule ID, and message displayed to the user."
