    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Linking the user-facing message to administrator evidence made this more informative than a generic failure. I could explain which SQL was restricted by which rule."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
