    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Enforcing Team Guidelines in Real Database Use"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "One small query rule connected configuration to real user results. I targeted the lab connection, tested SQL patterns, and checked guidance and audits."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Pattern tests and custom messages stood out. Administrators can check the intended coverage, while users can follow the guidance and continue working with corrected SQL."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
