      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Team database guidelines can become part of actual SQL execution."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Query Rules helps manage SQL usage alongside access privileges. The simple rule of naming required columns was enforced in DBeaver too."
        }
      ]
    },
